                            <comment id="14304770" author="vozerov" created="Wed, 4 Feb 2015 08:20:59 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Branch &quot;ignite-138&quot; in both repos.&lt;br/&gt;
What I am concerned about is that in some places (e.g. preloading) we have access only to shared cache context, so some messages for system cache are still sent over SYSTEM pool. &lt;br/&gt;
Let&apos;s discuss this.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="14313830" author="vozerov" created="Tue, 10 Feb 2015 08:38:31 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Suspicious places:&lt;br/&gt;
1) IgniteTxHandler.processCheckPreparedTxRequest;&lt;br/&gt;
2) IgniteTxHandler.sendCheckCommittedResponse.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
